# era-hotel-pms — module map

Entitlement keys: `hotel_distribution`, `hotel_banquets` (see `docs/adr/hotel-module-taxonomy.md`).

**Acceptance SSOT:** [Hotel-Acceptance-System](../../../docs/acceptance/Hotel-Acceptance-System.md) · [Product-Readiness](../../../docs/acceptance/Hotel-Product-Readiness-Matrix.md) · [Implementation-Matrix](../../../docs/acceptance/Hotel-Implementation-Matrix.md) · edition [`docs/editions/hotel.yaml`](../../../docs/editions/hotel.yaml)

**SaaS Wave 4 cron:** `PUT /api/service/recurring`, `POST /api/cron/auto-bar`, allotment cutoff, email-cron → `runCronForEachTenant` + `byOrganization` (`ERA_CRON_ORGANIZATION_IDS`). Not sellable SHARED pool.
