## CP workforce staff provision (Plan C)

| Route | API | Role |
|-------|-----|------|
| (event consumer) | `POST /api/integration/staff-provision` | `enterRequestTenant`; scrypt User hash; keyed on `cpEmploymentId` |
| (internal bind) | `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind` | Orchestrator Sync — persist deployment `organizationId` (ADR satellite-organization-bind) |
| (clinic cutover glue) | `GET /api/internal/v1/stays/by-external-ref` | Clinic `#21` — Elektraweb RESID/RESNAMEID → `Guest.globalPersonId` (Bearer event token) |
| Medical SKU dual-run (HOT-PKG-02) | `medical-package-resolve.service` + `reservation-notes` import + bridge note upsert; stamp `ReservationGuest.medicalPackageCode` | Extra Req `ERA-PKG` / agency → clinic `programCode`; not EW Rate Code. FO: `doc/nafta/ERA-PKG-FO-CHEATSHEET.md` |
| Composed package sell (HOT-PKG-03) | `nafta-package-compose.service` + `syncComposedDailyRates`; `STANDART_COMPANION` pricing component (96); night audit on resolved SKU; FO `/folio/[id]` `packageCompose` | Wave D; not SHIPPED |
| Per-pax lifecycle (HOT-PKG-04) | check-in **N events** per `ReservationGuest` (`programCode` + `paxKey` + `globalPersonId`); clinic opens one episode per pax | Wave E; share rooms stay two reservations |
| (clinic cutover glue) | `GET /api/internal/v1/guests/by-identity` | Clinic `#21` — name + birthDate + optional phone → `Guest.globalPersonId` |
| (placement slice) | `POST /api/internal/v1/placement/export-slice`, `…/import-slice` | Hotel curated JSON org slice + host agent upsert path (AC-CP-TOPO Scaffold ✅ still open) |
| (request org) | `src/lib/request-organization.ts` | SHARED ops stamps: ALS/`requestOrganizationId` (not process bind) |

Policy: hire master = orchestrator CP; hotel admin user create remains secondary seat guard only.

