## FO money / City Ledger (P5 — shipped 2026-08-03)

| Capability | Coverage | Backlog |
|------------|----------|---------|
| Transfer to CL at checkout | HOT-CO-02 | H-BL-40 |
| Deposit settle / checkout | HOT-CASH-03 | H-BL-41 |
| Payment refunds | HOT-CASH-04 | H-BL-42 |
| Discounts at settle/CO | HOT-CASH-05 | H-BL-43 |
| NA polish | HOT-NA-02 | H-BL-44 |
| Per-guest folio close | HOT-CO-03 | H-BL-45 |
| Agency settlement ops | HOT-AG-02 | H-BL-46 |
| List filters | HOT-UI-01 | H-BL-47 |
| Finance AR terms/aging/match | HOT-CL-05 | H-BL-48 |
| Early unused-nights refund | HOT-CO-04 | H-BL-49 |

**Routes:** `POST /api/reservations/[id]/check-out` (`transferToCityLedger`, unused nights opts), `GET /api/reservations/[id]/early-checkout-preview`, `POST /api/folios/settle` (DEPOSIT/discount), `POST /api/folios/payments/[id]/refund`, `POST /api/folios/[id]/close`, `GET|POST /api/agencies/[id]/settlement`. UI: `/folio/[reservationId]`, chessboard confirm, `/reports/agency-ledger`, `/operations` polish. Finance: `/reporting/aging`, `/sales/invoices/allocate`.

**UAT:** `doc/UAT-SMOKE.md` §27 P5 FO money. Unused-nights refund: §33.

ADR: `docs/adr/hotel-city-ledger-and-fo-money.md`. Early leave: `docs/adr/hotel-early-checkout-unused-nights.md`. Boundary: `docs/HOSPITALITY_FINANCE_BOUNDARY.md`.
See also: `doc/BACKLOG-PRODUCTION.md` § P5 · `docs/COVERAGE_MATRIX.md` HOT-CASH/CO/CL/NA/AG/UI.

